  "description": "Every climb? Owned. Every road? Yours to enjoy. This all-road e-bike utilizes our highest 01 Premium Carbon layup, keeping it feather-light yet razor-sharp under power. Add 250 watts of smooth, natural-feeling pedal assist from the TQ-HPR60 drive unit, seamlessly integrated, and you’ve got more possibilities to ride farther, lighter, freer.\nWide tire clearance, and tuned TCC Endurance compliance, mean you can take on broken roads, long days, and everything in between without compromise, while the discreet control unit on this carbon e-road bike handles power and connectivity without the clutter.\nCompleted with a dependable Shimano 105 Di2 groupset for precise shifting and braking, BMC’s ICS 2 stem and HB D4 alloy bars for an integrated, adjustable cockpit and AR 27 wheels for the core BMC all-road experience. The Roadmachine 01 AMP ONE is not about making the ride easier; it’s about amplifying what’s possible.",
